    acceptance: "Both App.tsx newConversation and SettingsPanel's 'New conversation' call closeSetup().",
    files: "App.tsx (lines 31-34), components/SettingsPanel.tsx (line 203)",
    prompt: "In App.tsx import closeSetup from useStudio() and call it at the start of newConversation(). In SettingsPanel, destructure closeSetup and call it before clearChat() in the button handler. Add a regression test in App.test.tsx that starting a new conversation while setupOpen is true flips it false. Run `npm --prefix apps/studio test -- --run` before handoff.",
    effort: "~30m",
  },
  {
